行吧，谢了你的电话和最新通报。
Well, thanks for the call
and the update.

936
00:53:31,620 --> 00:53:34,020
祝你们
好运连连啊。
I wish you
all the best of luck.

937
00:53:34,060 --> 00:53:37,980
哎，好吧，我们会坚持到底的。
我们得先去加个油，
Oh, well, we'll stick at it.
We're gonna have to
go and refuel,

938
00:53:38,020 --> 00:53:40,620
因为海浪实在太凶残，
发动机油耗比平时
because the sea
is so rough that
the engine's using more fuel

939
00:53:40,660 --> 00:53:41,980
还要高得多。
than it would normally.

940
00:53:42,020 --> 00:53:44,460
-行了，保重吧。
-好的。咬牙顶住。
-All right, take care.
-Okay. Stick at it.

941
00:53:44,500 --> 00:53:46,900
冷是冷得要死，
但我们还没完呢！
It's very cold,
but we're still in it!

942
00:53:46,940 --> 00:53:48,860
我们还没出局呢！
We're still in the race!

943
00:53:48,900 --> 00:53:50,500
哈蒙德：我根本不知道我们在哪儿，
HAMMOND: I didn't know
where we were,

944
00:53:50,540 --> 00:53:53,460
但我们心里清楚，
杰里米距离奥斯陆的
but we did know
Jeremy was only 50 miles

945
00:53:53,500 --> 00:53:55,460
终点线只有50英里了。
from the finishing
post in Oslo.

946
00:54:04,340 --> 00:54:07,060
必须得干掉那俩小子。
Got to beat those boys.

947
00:54:10,060 --> 00:54:13,580
不管怎样，
我都得赢过他们。
I have got to
beat them,
somehow.

948
00:54:24,460 --> 00:54:28,140
哈蒙德：
料想他肯定会死磕到底，
我们也是豁出命把船开到极限，
HAMMOND:
Knowing he'd be determined,
we gave the boat everything,

949
00:54:28,180 --> 00:54:30,900
心想倒霉事总不可能连着发生两回吧。
thinking that lightning
couldn't strike twice.

950
00:54:35,180 --> 00:54:37,140
但毫无悬念，它真来了。
But, of course, it did.

951
00:54:37,180 --> 00:54:39,700
见鬼！
Bugger!

952
00:54:39,740 --> 00:54:45,380
我们的充气快艇爆了。
我们必须立刻找块陆地靠岸。
Our rib had burst.
We had to get to
dry land fast.

953
00:54:45,420 --> 00:54:48,260
核心体温直线下跌，
失温症开始发作了。
Core temperature's dropping,
hypothermia's setting in.

954
00:54:48,300 --> 00:54:50,220
船头裂了，发动机报废了，
Boat's broken at the front,
engine's knackered,

955
00:54:50,260 --> 00:54:53,260
油快见底了，风浪太凶残，
冷得要命，
we're running out of fuel,
the sea's too rough,
it's freezing cold,

956
00:54:53,300 --> 00:54:54,900
恶劣天气又压上来了……
the weather's coming in...

957
00:54:54,940 --> 00:54:57,620
咱们干脆直接跳海
来个痛快算了？
Should we just
jump overboard
and end it quickly?

958
00:54:58,420 --> 00:54:59,500
真特么诱人啊，老兄。
Bloody tempting, mate.

959
00:55:04,580 --> 00:55:05,980
Sentrum，没错。
Sentrum,yes.

960
00:55:06,020 --> 00:55:08,620
Sentrum肯定是指市中心。
Sentrummust mean centre.

961
00:55:10,340 --> 00:55:12,100
我搞定了。
I got it.

962
00:55:12,140 --> 00:55:14,980
哈蒙德：
我们进了个小镇，
也不知道是哪儿，
HAMMOND:
We arrived in a town,
didn't know which one,

963
00:55:15,020 --> 00:55:17,340
只知道
我们得去坐大巴了。
knowing that
we'd have to get a bus.

964
00:55:17,380 --> 00:55:18,700
-[模仿引擎轰鸣声]
-妥了。
-[MIMICS ENGINE RUNNING]
-Yes.

965
00:55:18,740 --> 00:55:19,740
啊！
Ah!

966
00:55:23,460 --> 00:55:24,740
还得取点现金。
And some money.

967
00:55:24,780 --> 00:55:26,060
让我来弄。
Let me have a go.

968
00:55:26,100 --> 00:55:29,220
不，我来弄。
No, I'm going to do it.

969
00:55:29,260 --> 00:55:31,380
咱俩今天一起受了这么多苦，
现在可犯不着闹翻吧？
We've been through
a lot together today,
shall we not fall out now?

970
00:55:31,420 --> 00:55:32,660
行吧。
Okay.

971
00:55:34,300 --> 00:55:37,580
寻找一座手指指向前方的
巨型手部雕塑。
Look for the large sculpture
of a hand pointing.

972
00:55:41,580 --> 00:55:43,980
啊，根本就没有
什么指路的手啊！
Ah, there's no hand
doing anything!

973
00:55:51,740 --> 00:55:54,580
他们应该在这儿啊！
什么手啊？
They'll be here!
What hand?

974
00:55:56,180 --> 00:55:57,500
搞什么鬼！
Come on!

975
00:55:59,260 --> 00:56:00,940
他们人呢？
Where are they?

976
00:56:13,140 --> 00:56:15,780
他们到底在哪儿？
Where are they?

977
00:56:15,820 --> 00:56:17,940
克拉克森：
他们根本不在那儿。
CLARKSON:
They weren't there.

978
00:56:17,980 --> 00:56:19,940
甚至连边都没摸着。
They weren't even close.

979
00:56:19,980 --> 00:56:21,460
[电话铃声]
[RINGING TONE]

980
00:56:21,500 --> 00:56:23,620
杰里米，近来可好啊？
你在哪儿呢？
Jeremy, how are ya?
Where are ya?

981
00:56:23,660 --> 00:56:26,500
我挺好。不过嘛，
咱们开门见山吧，
I'm well. But, well,
let's cut to the chase,

982
00:56:26,540 --> 00:56:28,780
我已经到了，
而且都到了好半天了。
I'm here and have been
for some time.

983
00:56:29,500 --> 00:56:31,660
噢。好吧。
Oh. Right.

984
00:56:31,700 --> 00:56:33,780
所以很遗憾，
比赛已经结束了。
So I'm afraid
the race is done.

985
00:56:33,820 --> 00:56:38,540
不过我听说
你们那边
摊上大麻烦了。
But I gather that
you've got
some serious problems.

986
00:56:38,580 --> 00:56:40,700
呃，是啊，
我们搞坏了两艘船，
Um, yeah,
we've broken two boats,

987
00:56:40,740 --> 00:56:43,220
刚撞上一个特大的巨浪，
充气快艇直接爆了，
the rib burst when we hit
a particularly big wave,

988
00:56:43,260 --> 00:56:47,980
所以我们现在正瞎晃悠呢，
天晓得这是哪儿，
so we're now wandering around
I have no idea where,

989
00:56:48,020 --> 00:56:51,140
-估计只能找大巴了。
-[大笑]
-looking for a bus, I suppose.
-[LAUGHS]

990
00:56:51,180 --> 00:56:54,940
你觉得你们离奥斯陆
还有多远？
How far away are you,
do you think, from Oslo?

991
00:56:54,980 --> 00:56:56,980
说实话，
我真不知道。
To be honest,
I don't really know.

992
00:56:57,020 --> 00:57:01,580
听着，说真的，我会记挂你们的，
还有，呃，多保重啊。
Listen, honestly, I shall be
thinking of you,
and, um, take care.

993
00:57:01,620 --> 00:57:03,900
-好吧，谢了。
我们会小心的。拜。
-回头见。
-Okay, thank you.
We will. Bye.
-See you later.

994
00:57:04,980 --> 00:57:06,180
他已经到了，伙计。
He's there, mate.

995
00:57:13,700 --> 00:57:17,260
“见鬼”用挪威语
该怎么说来着？
What's the Norwegian
for "Oh, cock"?

996
00:57:17,300 --> 00:57:21,660
我还以为我今天够倒霉了，
结果，噢，并没有！
I thought I'd had a bad day,
but, oh, no!

997
00:57:23,300 --> 00:57:25,740
哈蒙德：我们现在到底该怎么办？
梅：打辆出租车。
HAMMOND: What the hell
do we do now?
MAY: Get a taxi.

998
00:57:25,780 --> 00:57:28,260
-哈蒙德：违规，不准坐。
-反正我现在用不着跑了，对吧？
-HAMMOND: Not allowed.
-Still, I don't need to
run, though, do I?

999
00:57:28,300 --> 00:57:30,860
哈蒙德：对，犯不上了！
反正跑也没意义了！
HAMMOND: No, I guess not!
I can't see much point!

1000
00:57:32,100 --> 00:57:33,740
[全场热烈掌声]
[LOUD APPLAUSE]

1001
00:57:33,780 --> 00:57:35,820
谢谢大家。
不过容我说一句……
Thank you.
Can I just say, though...

1002
00:57:38,540 --> 00:57:41,340
容我说一句，
当我们距离奥斯陆
还有50英里的时候，
Can I just say,
when we were
50 miles from Oslo

1003
00:57:41,380 --> 00:57:44,540
我们简直是并驾齐驱，
咬得死死的。
we were neck and neck,
absolutely neck and neck.

1004
00:57:44,580 --> 00:57:48,700
结果我都杀到奥斯陆、飞回英国、
晚饭都吃了一半了，
I made it to Oslo, flew home
and was halfway through supper

1005
00:57:48,740 --> 00:57:50,780
这两位才刚慢吞吞
赶到终点。
before these guys arrived
at the finishing point.

1006
00:57:50,820 --> 00:57:53,340
-他们到底搞得多砸，可见一斑。
-可不是嘛。
-That's how badly
it went wrong for them.
-Yeah.

1007
00:57:53,380 --> 00:57:56,540
我得说，那简直是世界尽头。
我们甚至都不知道
那鬼地方叫什么名字。
I have to say, it was the end.
We don't even know
what that place was called.

1008
00:57:56,580 --> 00:57:58,700
那个小镇。
鬼知道！反正就是荒郊野岭。
The town.
No idea! Just a place.

1009
00:57:58,740 --> 00:58:03,060
冷得要死，
没一个人跟我们讲英语，
而且我们身无分文。
Freezing cold,
nobody spoke English to us
and we had no money.

1010
00:58:03,100 --> 00:58:05,660
可不是嘛！后来好不容易找着台提款机，绝了，
上面显示：
No! Then there was
a cashpoint that was
unbelievable, it said,

1011
00:58:05,700 --> 00:58:08,260
“5000克朗”。
那是多少钱啊？
"5,000 kroner."
How much is that?

1012
00:58:08,300 --> 00:58:10,780
这钱够买个卷笔刀，
还是能买辆车？
Do I buy a pencil sharpener
or a car with that?

1013
00:58:10,820 --> 00:58:12,820
我只知道，
反正比他卡里的存款多，
All I know is
that's more than he had,

1014
00:58:12,860 --> 00:58:14,100
因为等他按下取款，屏幕上显示：
because when he
asked for that, it said,

1015
00:58:14,140 --> 00:58:15,460
“账户可用余额不足”，
"insufficient funds
available",

1016
00:58:15,500 --> 00:58:18,180
场面别提有多尴尬了。
which didn't go down well.

1017
00:58:18,220 --> 00:58:20,580
不过我觉得，我们证明了一点，
那就是如果你把旅程的掌控权
What we have proved,
though, I think, is that
if you let someone else

1018
00:58:20,620 --> 00:58:22,740
交到别人手里，就像我们一样……
take charge of your journey,
as we did...

1019
00:58:22,780 --> 00:58:24,540
-哪怕只交出一星半点。
-……就注定会翻车。
-At any point.
-...it goes wrong.

1020
00:58:24,580 --> 00:58:26,700
不过说实话，
这一次我不得不承认，
The thing is, though, that,
on this occasion,
I have to say,

1021
00:58:26,740 --> 00:58:29,180
坦白讲，
我的胜利完全是胜之不武。
my victory was,
frankly,
a hollow one.

1022
00:58:29,220 --> 00:58:32,540
这车确实神了，
轻轻松松一路开到奥斯陆。
The car was great.
It made it to Oslo easily.

1023
00:58:32,580 --> 00:58:34,140
换辆沃克斯豪尔·雅特我也能跑赢他们。
I could've beaten them
in a Vauxhall Astra.

1024
00:58:34,180 --> 00:58:39,740
但连开24小时下来，
我整个人在里面彻底散架了。
But, after 24 hours,
I was absolutely
wasted in there.

1025
00:58:39,780 --> 00:58:41,340
所以说到底，结论就是：
So, really, that's what
we have to say,

1026
00:58:41,380 --> 00:58:43,340
现代汽车唯一的软肋，
the weak point
of the modern car

1027
00:58:43,380 --> 00:58:46,500
-就是方向盘后面那坨软塌塌的有机肉体。
-确实。
-is the squidgy organic bit
behind the wheel.
-Yeah.

1028
00:58:46,540 --> 00:58:49,620
说白了就是我。好，伴着这颗重磅炸弹，本期节目只能到此结束了。
Me, basically. And on that
bombshell, we have to end.

1029
00:58:49,660 --> 00:58:51,460
我们下周再见，晚安！
See you again next week.
Goodnight.

